  "title": "Lessons through failure",
  "section": "Movie Facts # 2 of 10",
  "description": "When Lawrence Kasdan finished writing the screenplay for Raiders of the Lost Ark, he was hired to rewrite and improve George Lucas' draft for Empire. He wrote a few more drafts before a script conference was held in November between Lucas, Kasdan, director Irvin Kershner and producer Gary Kurtz. After some additional input, the shooting script for the movie as we know it was finally formed. Minor changes to dialogue came from Kershner and actors throughout the filming and were generally approved by Lucas. Harrison Ford famously added \"I know\" in response to Princess Leia's heartfelt declaration of love for Han Solo."
}
